<</Author(Dr. Carsten St\366cker)/CreationDate(D:20261101142916+01'00')/Creator(anonymous)/Keywords(Industrial AI; Evidence graphs; Semantic interoperability)/ModDate(D:20261101183353+00'00')/Producer(ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\))/Subject(Manufacturer, supplier and laboratory each connect local ontology capabilities to shared meaning, discovery and trust, with scoped exchanges through participant gateways.)/Title(P2: participant-controlled cooperation architecture)/Trapped null/Copyright(Copyright 2026 Dr. Carsten St\366cker, Spherity GmbH. CC BY 4.0 except where otherwise noted.)/License(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)/RightsSource(https://spherity.github.io/spherity-research/europes-answer-to-palantir.html#license-and-citation)/EditionDate(2026-11-01)>>
